Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  more above
  shift+tab, up          previous field
  left/right             choose the machine
  enter                  add
  backspace, ctrl+h      delete

 CTO box
  ctrl+], tab            back to Sessions
  esc                    skip tip
  enter                  opens the full CTO
  pgup/pgdn, ctrl+u/d    scroll
  m                      model
  n                      new
  u                      undo
  w                      drive

 Help
  T                      toggle tips
  R                      restart tips
  N                      desktop notifications: on (toggle)
  q                      quit
  esc, ?                 close help
  up/down, j/k           scroll
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end/G          first, last line

 Confirmations
  enter, y, Y            yes
  esc, n, N              no

 Forms
  enter                  submit or next field
  esc                    cancel
  tab/down               move to the next field
  shift+tab, up          previous field
  left/right             change the choice
  space                  toggle

up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
